									<h2 class="h4 icon-copy-header larger-h4-mob mob-mar-t-dbl">Card Highlights</h2>

									<div class="icon-copy-item-container card-icon-diamond">
										<div>
											<h3 class="icon-copy-title">Book any airline, any flight, anytime</h3>
											<p class="icon-copy-text">Use your Avion points and enjoy flexible bookings options with the freedom to choose from over 500 airlines. No blackouts, no seat restrictions — even during peak season, and even at the last minute. </p>
