										<div>
											<h3 class="icon-copy-title">Use Points Your Way</h3>
											<p class="icon-copy-text">Redeem your Avion points for other travel related expenses and more. Plus, Avion points never expire<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-15" class="scrollto">15</a></sup>.</p>
										</div>
									</div>
									<div class="icon-copy-item-container card-icon-price-tag">
										<div>
											<h3 class="icon-copy-title">Get Extensive Insurance</h3>
											<p class="icon-copy-text">Enjoy more peace of mind with coverage like unlimited emergency medical insurance<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-9" class="scrollto">9</a></sup>, travel accident insurance<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-7" class="scrollto">7</a></sup>, trip cancellation insurance<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-7" class="scrollto">7</a></sup>, mobile device insurance<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-7" class="scrollto">7</a></sup>, and more.</p>
										</div>
