										</div>
                        				<div class="points-block">
    <p class="points-square no-wrap">70,000</p>
    <p class="points-content"><strong>70,000 Avion points</strong><sup><a href='/credit-cards/travel/rbc-avion-visa-infinite.html#legal-1' class='legal_bug'>1</a></sup> is enough for two round-trip flights anywhere in Canada or the US<sup><a href='/credit-cards/travel/rbc-avion-visa-infinite.html#legal-dagger' class='legal_bug'>†</a></sup> or 4 round-trip flights in or to an adjacent Canadian province/territory or US State<sup><a href='/credit-cards/travel/rbc-avion-visa-infinite.html#legal-hat' class='legal_bug'>^</a></sup>. Taxes and fees extra<sup><a href='/credit-cards/travel/rbc-avion-visa-infinite.html#legal-dagger' class='legal_bug'>†</a></sup><sup><a href='/credit-cards/travel/rbc-avion-visa-infinite.html#legal-hat' class='legal_bug'>^</a></sup></p>
</div>
									</div>
