										<div>
											<h3 class="icon-copy-title">Book Flights for Maximum Value</h3>
											<p class="icon-copy-text">Make your Avion points go further with <a href="https://www.avionrewards.com/travel/redemptionSchedule.html">fixed-points pricing</a> offered 365 days a year<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-dagger" class="scrollto">†</a></sup>.</p>
