											<p class="icon-copy-text">Use your Avion points towards hotel stays, car rentals and more using the simple conversion: 100 points = $1<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-19" class="scrollto">19</a></sup>, use them to cover taxes and fees, and more.</p>
