										src="/credit-cards/transformer/img/cards/petrocanada.png" width="300" height="200"alt="Petro canada logo">
								</div>
								<p class="mar-b-0">Link your cards and instantly save 3¢/L on fuel<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-4" class="scrollto">4</a></sup> and earn 20% more Petro-Points<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-5" class="scrollto">5</a></sup> and Avion points<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-6" class="scrollto">6</a></sup> at Petro-Canada</p>
							</div>
							<p><a href="https://www.rbcroyalbank.com/petro-canada/index.html" target="_blank" class="standalone-link-after" style="font-weight: 400;">Learn More</a></p>
						</div>
						<div class="exclusive-offer-item flex-one">
							<div class="exclusive-offer-item eh">
								<div class="img-container">
									<img id="triangle-rewards-img"
										src="/credit-cards/transformer/img/cards/logo-triangle-rewards.png" alt="Triangle Rewards logo" width="300" height="200">
								</div>
								<p class="mar-b-0">Earn 3x Canadian Tire Money<sup>®</sup> at Canadian Tire, Sport Chek, Mark's, and more when you scan your Triangle Rewards<sup>®</sup> card and pay with your linked RBC Card.<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-28" class="scrollto">28</a></sup></p>
							</div>
							<p><a href="https://www.avionrewards.com/partnerships/triangle-rewards/" target="_blank" class="standalone-link-after" style="font-weight: 400;">Learn More</a></p>
						</div>
						<div class="exclusive-offer-item flex-one">
							<div class="exclusive-offer-item eh">
								<div class="img-container">
									<img id="doordash-img"
										src="/credit-cards/transformer/img/cards/doordash.png" width="300" height="200"alt="Doordash logo">
								</div>
								<p class="mar-b-0">Add your credit card to your DoorDash account and get a free 12 monthly DashPass subscription<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-16" class="scrollto">16</a></sup></p>
							</div>
							<p><a href="https://www.rbcroyalbank.com/doordash/index.html" target="_blank" class="standalone-link-after" style="font-weight: 400;">Learn More</a></p>
						</div>
						<div class="exclusive-offer-item flex-one">
							<div class="exclusive-offer-item eh">
								<div class="img-container">
									<img id="rexall-img" src="/credit-cards/transformer/img/cards/rexall.png" width='300' height='200'
										alt="Rexall logo">
								</div>
								<p class="mar-b-0">Link your RBC Credit Card and earn 50 Be Well™ points on every $1 spent on eligible purchases at Rexall<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-13" class="scrollto">13</a></sup></p>
							</div>
