								<div class="mobile-only custom-callout-img" style="background-image: url('/credit-cards/transformer/img/cards/travel.png'); border-radius: 8px;">

								</div>


								<div class="responsive-flexbox responsive-flex-direction-column">
									<h4>Travel<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-22" class="scrollto">22</a></sup></h4>
									<p>Access the Visa Infinite Hotel Collection and enjoy benefits like free nights at premium hotels, discounts, room upgrades and free breakfasts at over 900 Visa Infinite Luxury Hotel Collection properties around the world. Visa Infinite card holders also have discounts at Park n’ Fly, Viator and Via Rail.</p>
								</div>
							</div>

						</div>
