								<div class="mobile-only custom-callout-img" style="background-image: url('/credit-cards/transformer/img/cards/food-and-wine.png'); border-radius: 8px;">

								</div>

								<div class="responsive-flexbox responsive-flex-direction-column">
									<h4>Food and Wine<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-22" class="scrollto">22</a></sup></h4>
									<p>Indulge in curated dining events from some of the finest restaurants around Canada with the Visa Infinite Dining Series. Also, cardholders are treated to exciting wine country benefits like curated tours, elevated tasting experiences, preferred pricing and more<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-27" class="scrollto">27</a></sup>.</p>
								</div>
							</div>
