								<div class="mobile-only custom-callout-img" style="background-image: url('/credit-cards/transformer/img/cards/international-data.png'); border-radius: 8px;">

								</div>

								<div class="responsive-flexbox responsive-flex-direction-column">
									<h4>International Data<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-22" class="scrollto">22</a></sup></h4>
									<p>Stay connected in 175+ countries with discounted GigSky data using your eligible Visa card. Visa Infinite cardholders get 1GB/15 days complimentary plan, plus 20% off all plans on eSIM-compatible devices.</p>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="grid-half">
