									<h4>Complimentary Concierge<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-23" class="scrollto">23</a></sup></h4>
									<p>Whether you're looking to book travel plans, get a restaurant recommendation or find that perfect gift, Visa's complimentary <a href="https://www.visainfinite.ca/infinite/en/concierge.html" target="_blank" class="externalsite-link no-wrap">concierge</a> service will do the research for you and help save you time, with 24/7 availability to help make your experience extraordinary.</p>
								</div>
