			<section id="travel-canada">
				<div class="section-inner">
					<h2 class="text-center mar-b">Travel Canada in Style with Avion</h2>
					<p class="text-center award-paragraph">Whether you're heading to the coast or the mountains, your Avion Rewards help you make the most of Canadian Travel</p>
					
					<div class="grid-wpr eh-wpr">
						<div class="grid-half pad-b">
							<h4>Avion Points</h4>
							<p>Use Avion points to book flights across Canada with no blackout dates, or use it to book hotels, car rentals, and more.<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-caret" class="scrollto">^</a></sup></p>
						</div>
						<div class="grid-half pad-b">
							<h4>Linked Loyalty</h4>
							<p>Link your card with Petro-Canada to save 3¢/L on fuel<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-4" class="scrollto">4</a></sup> and earn 20% more points on gas<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-5" class="scrollto">5</a></sup>– perfect for Canadian road trips.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="grid-half pad-b">
							<h4>Insurance for Peace of Mind</h4>
							<p>Wherever you travel within Canada, your journey is safeguarded with extensive insurance from emergency medical coverage<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-9" class="scrollto">9</a></sup>, trip interruption and cancellation insurance<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-7" class="scrollto">7</a></sup> and more.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="grid-half">
							<h4>Visa Infinite Benefits</h4>
							<p>Stay at top Canadian hotels, save on Via Rail and Park n'Fly and enjoy curated dining and wine experiences<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-22" class="scrollto">22</a></sup> across Canada.</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<img id="img-travel-canada" src="/credit-cards/transformer/img/cards/travel-canada.svg" alt="Travel Canada">
				</div>
			</section>

			<section id="redeem-on-flights">
				<div class="section-inner">
