                    <p class="disclaimer text-center mar-t">*Excluding any applicable taxes, surcharges and fees.</p>
                    <p class="text-center mar-t">Avion credit cardholders can also redeem for all types of travel<sup><a href="/credit-cards/travel/avion-rbc-credit-cards.html#legal-32" ><span class="offscreen">Legal Disclaimer</span>32</a></sup>, using this simple conversion<sup><a href="/credit-cards/travel/avion-rbc-credit-cards.html#legal-23" ><span class="offscreen">Legal Disclaimer</span>23</a></sup> <span class="fw-700">100 points = $1 CAD</span></p>
				</div>
