			<section class="" id="faq">
				<div class="section-inner pad-t-dbl">

					<h2 class="text-center">Top RBC Avion Visa Infinite Questions</h2>

					<div class="accordion mar-t-dbl" id="accordionSet2">
						<div class="grid-wpr">
							<div class="grid-half">
								<div class="accordion-panel">
									<button id="accordion-title-faq-1" class="collapse-toggle collapsed"
										data-target="#accordion-faq-1" data-toggle="collapse"
										data-parent="#accordionSet2" aria-expanded="false"
										aria-controls="accordion-faq-1">How does the RBC Avion Visa Infinite work?</button>
									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion-faq-1" role="region"
										aria-labelledby="accordion-title-faq-1">
										<div class="collapse-inner">
											The RBC Avion Visa Infinite is a travel rewards credit card that allows cardholders to earn Avion points for their purchases and gives them an automatic Avion Rewards Elite membership. Points can be redeemed for various travel rewards, including flights, hotel stays, car rentals, and more. Cardholders have the flexibility to book travel on any airline, at any time, with no blackout dates or restrictions.
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="accordion-panel">
									<button id="accordion-title-faq-2" class="collapse-toggle collapsed"
										data-target="#accordion-faq-2" data-toggle="collapse"
										data-parent="#accordionSet2" aria-expanded="false"
										aria-controls="accordion-faq-2">How do I earn Avion points?</button>
									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion-faq-2" role="region"
										aria-labelledby="accordion-title-faq-2">
										<div class="collapse-inner">
											You earn 1 Avion point for every $1 CAD you spend with your credit card<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-2" class="scrollto">2</a></sup> plus 25% more when you use your card to pay for travel<sup><a href="#" class="scrollto">12</a></sup>.
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="accordion-panel">
									<button id="accordion-title-faq-3" class="collapse-toggle collapsed"
										data-target="#accordion-faq-3" data-toggle="collapse"
										data-parent="#accordionSet3" aria-expanded="false"
										aria-controls="accordion-faq-3">What can I redeem Avion points on?</button>
									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion-faq-3" role="region"
										aria-labelledby="accordion-title-faq-3">
										<div class="collapse-inner">
											<p>Redeem on travel, such as:</p>
											<ul class="disc-list">
												<li>Flights</li>
												<li>Hotel stays</li>
												<li>Car rentals</li>
												<li>Cruises</li>
												<li>Vacation packages</li>
												<li>Tours</li>
												<li>Converting points to other loyalty and frequent flyer programs such as WestJet Rewards, British Airways Executive Club and American Airlines AAdvantage</li>
											</ul>
											<p>You can also redeem points for:</p>
											<ul class="disc-list">
												<li>Gift cards</li>
												<li>Brand-name merchandise from top brands like</li>
												<li>Apple and Best Buy</li>
												<li>RBC Financial Rewards<sup>®</sup></li>
												<li>Charitable donations</li>
												<li>Points conversion to other loyalty programs</li>
												<li>Pay with points</li>
											</ul>
											<p>For more about Avion Rewards™, including complete terms and conditions, visit <a href="https://avionrewards.com" target="_blank" class="externalsite-link">avionrewards.com</a>.</p>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="accordion-panel">
									<button id="accordion-title-faq-6" class="collapse-toggle collapsed"
										data-target="#accordion-faq-6" data-toggle="collapse"
										data-parent="#accordionSet6" aria-expanded="false"
										aria-controls="accordion-faq-6">How do I redeem Avion points?</button>
									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion-faq-6" role="region"
										aria-labelledby="accordion-title-faq-6">
										<div class="collapse-inner">
											<p>To redeem your points, sign into Avion Rewards online or through the app, then select either “Travel “or “Redeem” in the nav bar or menu.</p>
											<p>For more information and to redeem for flights, visit <a href="https://avionrewards.com/travel" target="_blank" class="externalsite-link">avionrewards.com/travel</a>.</p>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="grid-half">
								<div class="accordion-panel">
									<button id="accordion-title-faq-7" class="collapse-toggle collapsed"
										data-target="#accordion-faq-7" data-toggle="collapse"
										data-parent="#accordionSet7" aria-expanded="false"
										aria-controls="accordion-faq-7">How do I convert Avion Rewards into other loyalty program's points, miles or partner rewards?</button>
									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion-faq-7" role="region"
										aria-labelledby="accordion-title-faq-7">
										<div class="collapse-inner">
											<p>Avion points can be converted into American Airlines AAdvantage miles, British Airways Avios and WestJet points.</p>
											<p>To find out more, sign in to Avion Rewards and visit the <a href="https://www.rbcrewards.com/#/manage-points" target="_blank" class="externalsite-link">Convert Points section</a>.</p>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="accordion-panel">
									<button id="accordion-title-faq-8" class="collapse-toggle collapsed"
										data-target="#accordion-faq-8" data-toggle="collapse"
										data-parent="#accordionSet8" aria-expanded="false"
										aria-controls="accordion-faq-8">Does the RBC Avion Visa Infinite card include travel insurance?</button>
									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion-faq-8" role="region"
										aria-labelledby="accordion-title-faq-8">
										<div class="collapse-inner">
											<p>Your RBC Avion Visa Infinite card comes with a suite of extensive travel insurance<sup><a href="#legalvisainfiniteavion-8" class="scrollto">8</a></sup>, including:</p>
											<ul class="disc-list">
												<li>Out of Province/Country Emergency Medical Insurance</li>
												<li>Travel Accident Insurance</li>
												<li>Auto Rental Collision/Loss Damage Waiver Insurance</li>
												<li>Trip Cancellation & Trip Interruption Insurance</li>
												<li>Delayed Baggage and Flight Delay Insurance</li>
												<li>Hotel/Motel Burglary Insurance</li>
												<li>Purchase Security & Extended Warranty Insurance</li>
												<li>Mobile Device Insurance</li>
											</ul>
											<p>For more details regarding all available insurances on this card, <a href="https://www.rbcroyalbank.com/credit-cards/travel/rbc-visa-infinite-avion/rbc-visa-infinite-avion-certificate-of-insurance.pdf" target="_blank" class="standalone-pdf">click here</a>.</p>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="accordion-panel">
									<button id="accordion-title-faq-9" class="collapse-toggle collapsed"
										data-target="#accordion-faq-9" data-toggle="collapse"
										data-parent="#accordionSet9" aria-expanded="false"
										aria-controls="accordion-faq-9">What is the Air Travel Redemption schedule?</button>
									<div class="collapse-content collapse" id="accordion-faq-9" role="region"
										aria-labelledby="accordion-title-faq-9">
										<div class="collapse-inner">
											<p>Redeem for flights using a fixed amount of Avion points based on the destination through the <a href="https://www.avionrewards.com/travel/redemptionSchedule.html" target="_blank" class="externalsite-link">Air Travel Redemption</a> Grid.</p>
											<p>Destinations have a maximum ticket price. If a ticket costs more than the allowed amount, you can charge the difference to your RBC Avion Visa Infinite card, or you can pay with points. </p>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

